<outcomestext name="Outcomes">
<![CDATA[
<h2>Learning Outcomes</h2>
<p>Upon successful completion of the program, graduates will:</p>
<ol>
	<li>Be able to analyze a problem, and identify, define, and verify the appropriate computational tools required to solve it.</li>
	<li>Be able to apply up-to-date computational tools necessary in a variety of computing practices.</li>
	<li>Be able to implement algorithms as programs using modern computer languages.</li>
	<li>Be able to apply their mathematical knowledge to solve computational problems.</li>
	<li>Be able to communicate computer science knowledge both orally and in writing.</li>
	<li>Be able to collaborate in teams.</li>
</ol>
]]>
</outcomestext>
